# Self-Improvement Repository

Simple utility functions for testing LLM-powered auto-improvements.

## Functions
- add(a, b) - Addition
- multiply(a, b) - Multiplication
- validate_email(email) - Email validation
- count_words(text) - Word counting
- reverse_string(s) - String reversal

## How to use
```python
from utils import add
result = add(2, 3)